<title>UK: UK PMI brightens manufacturing outlook - Treasury.</title>
<headline>UK PMI brightens manufacturing outlook - Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The September UK PMI survey backs the brighter manufacturing outlook suggested by recent business surveys, the Treasury said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;This reinforces the message of recent business surveys indicating brighter prospects for manufacturing,&quot; a Treasury spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Mariam Isa ++44 171 542 7708</p>
